# M9 "İlk Kan" (docs/PROTOCOL_COMBAT.md): a new Aydor warrior leaves Ortaocak's safe ground, targets
# the nearest Kül Çömezi (target frame, selection ring, level-tinted label), starts the auto-attack
# (walking into range), uses Ağır Darbe (key 1) when it is ready, kills it (death clip, corpse) and
# gains experience (xp bar). Run at 1280x720 and 1600x900 @125 % (run-ui-flows.ps1 flow "combat").
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m9_combat
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.aydor
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.1
clickon create.name
text Kulavcisi
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded 1800
expect world+safezone+level1+alive+fullhp+notarget
# Let the zone banner fade out; the HUD with hp / mp / xp bars and the skill button.
wait 200
scene camera behind 25 8
wait 10
screenshot 01_village_hud.png
# Out of the village towards the nearest thrall, stopping outside its aggro radius.
waitfor world+monsters 600
scene walktomonster Kül Çömezi 9
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
expect world+outsidesafe
scene target nearest Kül Çömezi
scene camera behind 32 9
wait 20
expect world+target+targetmonster
screenshot 02_target.png
# Esc drops the target first (the menu stays closed), Tab picks the nearest monster again.
key escape
wait 3
expect world+notarget
expect world+invclosed
key tab
wait 3
expect world+target+targetmonster
scene target nearest Kül Çömezi
# F: auto-attack, walking into range.
key f
waitfor world+attacking+ownhits1 900
waitfor world+skillready 400
key 1
waitfor world+skillhits1 300
scene camera side 28 7
wait 4
screenshot 03_fight_numbers.png
scene combatlog
waitfor world+kills1 1800
expect world+targetdead+alive
wait 40
scene camera side 30 6
wait 5
screenshot 04_corpse.png
scene combatlog
wait 30
screenshot 05_xp_after_kill.png
quit
